{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "dfc18b6f61a4975b7457fbe1918d2e52d103d6a93359cf1bc6240dcb407d99bf", "ja": "黄昏の迷子", "zh": "黄昏中的迷途者", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d57305cc2a6fc86acf7c952c323304c2d6b242a4c3fc76dcb5e53a3151e7cb54", "ja": "瑞希と杏奈も現場入りし、撮影は順調。だが\nその途中、千早と美希はエミリーの歌に違和\n感を覚えたと告げる。春香と真が励ますが、\n落ち込んでしまうエミリー。", "zh": "瑞希和杏奈也来到现场，拍摄进展顺利。但是  \n在这期间，千早和美希说她们觉得艾米莉的歌声  \n有些不对劲。春香和真鼓励着她，  \n但艾米莉还是消沉了下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b5fbdc0d6ffe757319c5af71c4cc6e6763b36d710d4c88a0724a0a7430b5efbb", "ja": "（『近未来アウトサイダー』の撮影は想定より\n早く進んでいる。今日は、瑞希と杏奈が見学に来た）", "zh": "（《近未来局外人》的拍摄比预想中进行得更快。今天瑞希和杏奈来参观了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "727daca3eb54dba2f4f4f7a0d66661d6e8adf613e5fbfe70888973420182ca5c", "ja": "そろそろふたりの撮影も始まるし、\n今日はスタンドインをやっていってもらおうかな。", "zh": "差不多也要开始拍你们两个的戏了，今天就先帮忙做替身吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "0dedbdfc2767fe2cbcc21c66763c1f7441157da1abf93ca88267d62d0045483f", "ja": "{$P$}、さん……\nスタンドインって……何……？", "zh": "{$P$}，先生……\n替身演员……是……什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "ad52bedecb85c1c54978bc7cbe8e05eae8bc3ead192e2c7d1d20b6d1c8065bfe", "ja": "スタンドインとは、カメラの位置や照明などを決める、\n撮影の準備だそうです。……業界用語。", "zh": "所谓替身，是为了确定摄像机位置和灯光等，为拍摄做准备……听说是行业术语。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d8edc95e274c05d090f8636837285a94f7955af5b2f4f40150e71b933770bcfb", "ja": "代役の人やスタッフさんがやる事もあるし、本人が\nやる事もあるかな。瑞希、杏奈、やってみるか？", "zh": "有时会由替身或工作人员来做，也有本人来做的吧。瑞希、杏奈，要不要试试？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "b87a1b61af100b971b0fba8d9fa056d2635f977a6118112351049ed12c7b6f94", "ja": "はい、撮影に関わることでしたら、ぜひ。\nよろしくお願いします、{$P$}。", "zh": "好的，只要是和拍摄有关的事情，我很愿意帮忙。\n请多关照，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "39a527cc3a9bc18f1e7af0f6908e8a5c86731ed08b98478ba50bd58fcc8cf8d7", "ja": "ん……杏奈も、やる……\nよろしく、お願いします……。", "zh": "嗯……杏奈也会努力的……\n请多关照……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "4893f2c30a7de2f7329e0394c504364114c7d97a6ce8d149b17b03b89bc390a9", "ja": "瑞希さん、杏奈さん、よろしくお願いいたします！\n一緒にがんばりましょうね♪", "zh": "瑞希小姐、杏奈小姐，请多多关照！\n让我们一起加油吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1008_staff", "source_sha256": "e984073d759ed41d78753ffa27e22ed9a69bb50ed896dc2a9a026d83d2f8ca87", "ja": "それでは、スタンドイン始めます！\nみなさんスタンバイ、よろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "那么，开始走位排练！\n大家准备就绪，拜托啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "62a29dc21c911a366b656c0935c02198d01b2ee513492bb76d38566014ae433f", "ja": "あっ、さっそく始まるみたいですね。\n参りましょう！", "zh": "啊，看来马上就要开始了。\n我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "0432d36dcdadf3d2bc35ba263dfb228b0768183fc66153c067c06ee3e2085f8c", "ja": "なんと……珍しい物を見た。こいつは、\n旧世界の武器だ。あんた、どこでこれを手に入れた？", "zh": "没想到……居然看到了稀罕物。这是旧世界的武器。你是从哪儿弄到的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "25d589f5b5cf1886af02794df5d3456a37b2ad6e8ed2ab1ce41895b98c49d607", "ja": "コイツは、生まれた瞬間から俺の相棒だ。\n他の人間が使ったことはない。", "zh": "这家伙从诞生的那一刻起就是我的搭档。\n从来没被其他人用过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "ed3403de0cd7b3503c6a3b17cf776cabfc4e577cb7b0f9e2886a91f954e5549b", "ja": "質問は、研ぎ直せるのか？　それとも直せないのか？\n……だ。これ以上詮索するなら、他をあたる。", "zh": "问题是，能不能重新磨利？还是不能？\n……就是这样。再继续追问的话，你去找别人吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "2f8889fee30226b64f0e3fee0671d27cf2e32edaa6a37382ffd6f691cb6b5d2b", "ja": "ああ、すまない。いや、ちょっと驚いただけなんだ。\nこの辺りに、私より腕のいい鍛冶師はいないと思うよ。", "zh": "啊，抱歉。只是稍微有点惊讶而已。\n我觉得这一带没有比我手艺更好的锻造师了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "efe77bdf29fae4f526ecf9cc19d9f8ad68dfa7337e2ac437458040e3f86e8781", "ja": "という事は……？", "zh": "也就是说……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "a20abc756fafdcd48d04a602d304334eaa450761ef284c59b3dac1a0865064e9", "ja": "もちろんやらせてもらうよ。\nあんた達は、私や市のみんなの、命の恩人だしな。", "zh": "我当然愿意接。\n毕竟你们可是我和全市所有人的救命恩人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1018_p", "source_sha256": "bfc5da3c049cf6922e7580b8142d4649e168e61fe458c48d92e3a84bba518817", "ja": "（次はいよいよ、アウトレイジ軍本拠地でのシーン。\nエミリー……アマリリスが初めて歌うところだ）", "zh": "（接下来终于要到暴行军本部的场景了。艾米莉……阿马莉莉丝第一次歌唱的地方）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "6971dec88909487a674aa78464e46cc89e4c10e06434f5ac978c8a4637f68e61", "ja": "さあ、アマリリス。歌うのだ。私のためにではない。\n旧世界を滅ぼし、新しい世界を祝福しろ。", "zh": "来吧，阿玛丽莉丝。歌唱吧。不是为了我。毁灭旧世界，祝福新世界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "0e57896293f3c9b3a1a30de69b94067a0037c7623ac691964f979b142fc7f4be", "ja": "あ、あの……ファイナルデイ様。\nでも……まだ、声が……。", "zh": "啊，那个……终焉之日大人。\n可是……声音……还……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "4dbc027f8cf547626d9f6b1be3e62048f35cbcd6f6acb0cec1600db55924c189", "ja": "えっ……！？\n声が……いつの間に……？", "zh": "咦……！？\n声音……什么时候……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "bc118eb444c48427ad5aa31a07eb7bf1fc85ff402ca2bcbaf6c36023b998e9e9", "ja": "そうだ……それでいい。アマリリス。\nお前の歌声こそが鍵。だからこそ、お前達は……。", "zh": "没错……这样就好。阿玛丽利斯。\n你的歌声才是关键。正因为如此，你们才……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "814cd21e7417b80fccff21e19c939c7d6d1294b32221bab3efeb50cf7b09eb35", "ja": "ファイナルデイ様！　ただいま戻りました。\n何か問題でもありましたか？", "zh": "Final Day大人！我回来了。  \n发生什么问题了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "fd00b5c4ca2f80a0450d3383804194b379907181ad3a94e7b81a9e6fd1b62c77", "ja": "……ッ！？", "zh": "……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "4954fe3c37bbd6fbf03cef474cf6f68134eaf70b3fb5fb0b3b126d3a085a9300", "ja": "フン……どうした、小鳥。\nオレの顔を見た途端、歌うのを止めるなんて。", "zh": "哼……怎么了，小鸟？\n一看到我的脸就停止唱歌，是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "1d3832e83ebc9dcb3875b9ebfd05c44b7b99d331bc545d19d76e8e806024d861", "ja": "ア……ウ……。", "zh": "啊……呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1028_006mak", "source_sha256": "487ce9dca57cf167279c3d171434f3858818d600d35db8f0a5860dcdabd64d6a", "ja": "せいぜい歌えよ。お前は小鳥なんだから。\nさえずるくらいしか能がない。そうだろ？", "zh": "你就尽管唱吧。你可是只小鸟嘛。除了叽叽喳喳，你也没别的本事。对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1029_032emi", "source_sha256": "e4137027f732e55daa8c402c514bbe3b7687d51a8ccb4a87b29d32515aefc8ab", "ja": "ウゥ……。", "zh": "呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1031_032emi", "source_sha256": "53d6d5f85899ba5ff4a990b82d59b276f9b8b6f44225ef617b8de0cf3e4e3193", "ja": "ただいま戻りました！\n仕掛け人さま！　あの、いかがでしたか……？", "zh": "我回来了！\n制作人先生！那个，感觉怎么样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1032_p", "source_sha256": "3745764923fd777f5ec3604e7d70a8c46ab22e21a77c178682b839fda9e74191", "ja": "お疲れさま！　うん、スタンドインとはいえ、\nなかなか本番の雰囲気が出せていたんじゃないかな。", "zh": "辛苦了！嗯，虽说只是替身，不过应该已经相当有正式演出的感觉了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1033_p", "source_sha256": "c32c9cbc4ae4ffef0cc614e0ec828bdaf727b46995baa0b37c8d1aa79d5c7001", "ja": "あとは、歌の雰囲気を……エミリー？\n何してるんだ？", "zh": "接下来就是歌曲的氛围了……艾米莉？\n你在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1034_032emi", "source_sha256": "035c256a237a4aefeda6636752b44e654dd2532c4f8eae960954e3943cd33899", "ja": "あっ、すみません、仕掛け人さま。\n今日は、みなさんにお茶菓子を持ってきたので……。", "zh": "啊，对不起，制作人先生。\n今天我给大家带了些茶点，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1035_p", "source_sha256": "9600c3fbe51c9e606c9d2b748d78ab9458ca5ccdd775cd49187680dc9090d429", "ja": "ああ、この前春香と話してたやつか。\nうん、みんなも喜ぶんじゃないかな。", "zh": "啊，是前些天和春香聊到的那个啊。\n嗯，我想大家也会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1036_003mik", "source_sha256": "52d6bd23b5faebbef776b487dd05aca4db51b6f7b62519ada36818a6a632d870", "ja": "エミリー、{$P$}、お疲れさまなの。\nあのね、ミキ、すこし気になったんだけど。", "zh": "艾米莉，{$P$}，辛苦啦。\n那个呢，美希刚才有点在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1037_003mik", "source_sha256": "e0288396be0d3270fedf0a057ffb4ddbdf421b51dc361af4e14c10f34c476b2a", "ja": "今のシーン、エミリーの歌が、\nなんか浮いてるって思うな。", "zh": "刚才那一段，我觉得艾米莉的歌声好像有点突兀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1038_032emi", "source_sha256": "f6b93e1be1ba2521523fa4c05be5cf6291a75327e0f2239a9aa57703b62341f5", "ja": "えっ……！", "zh": "咦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1039_001har", "source_sha256": "b3da188c1fe17c773bd3fdd7e07343acfa1e2cdf5fc9cd6621125013c559df20", "ja": "えっ……そ、そうかな？　エミリーちゃん、\nけっこういい感じに歌えてたと思うけど……。", "zh": "咦……是、是这样吗？我觉得艾米莉唱得还挺不错的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1040_003mik", "source_sha256": "a65091b82eb3e343090b56241fc10cf99d98c0be7d626ed664cd7cac1ec9194a", "ja": "うん。エミリー自体は、いい感じだったよ？\nでもなんか、違うと思うな。", "zh": "嗯。艾米莉本人表现得挺不错的哦？\n不过总觉得，还是有些不对劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1041_006mak", "source_sha256": "4170774a66bbd377ecdbeae672be7766cf1656717104569610c733dfb9733ae2", "ja": "ええっ？\nそれってどういうことなのさ、美希。", "zh": "诶？\n这是什么意思啊，美希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1042_032emi", "source_sha256": "adad115968eed4c172fbc96428f1de69a9c77b0fc4f2852153e1320a14e57dc7", "ja": "なんか違う……。", "zh": "总觉得不太对……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1043_p", "source_sha256": "4df574198afab46ff461b307ac7af4e6ab69d80b56fc588efcd852d61cc77566", "ja": "美希……せっかくのアドバイスなんだから、もう少し\n丁寧に言ってくれないか？　エミリーが困ってるぞ。", "zh": "美希……难得是给出的建议，你能不能说得再客气一点？艾米莉都不知道该怎么办了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1044_003mik", "source_sha256": "36fbed16bef02446f67240992870194ed9f45f7ffaf08612bf021804b8ee37b1", "ja": "丁寧に……って、どんなカンジで言えばいいの？\n千早さん。", "zh": "要说得更客气些……那要用什么感觉来说才好呢，千早？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1045_002chi", "source_sha256": "4c748eb38db5be6c039d72b2469356550f1ecb957e167b542e3c3c2307a663ce", "ja": "そうね……うまく言えないのだけど……。けど、\n美希の言いたいことは、なんとなくわかるような……。", "zh": "是啊……我也说不太好……不过，\n我好像能大致明白美希想表达的意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1046_002chi", "source_sha256": "3d85956ae8f10c895f0a16a98bd72a22586b2d80f046f0dec3ef63f49a6d5222", "ja": "私も、今のエミリーの歌には、\nすこしだけ違和感を覚えていたから。", "zh": "我也觉得，刚才艾米莉的歌声有些许违和感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1047_032emi", "source_sha256": "985c02e5b2b0b259e5320e40fc18d1865f53f203457ad21bc3605cd5d4978d8c", "ja": "えっ……そ、そうだったのですか？", "zh": "诶……原来……是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1048_002chi", "source_sha256": "777db53008acbc1ba1fae1c91b7332e8126e8a20c24354909ae5bf0ae54493d7", "ja": "ええ。でも、何がどうと言えなくて……。\nごめんなさい、エミリー。考えてみるわ。", "zh": "是的。不过，我也说不清到底是怎么回事……\n对不起，艾米莉。我会想想看的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1049_032emi", "source_sha256": "353941ee8a5df87c9c55681c76ccddd3142e2e93fa00cc6055487488fd150764", "ja": "は、はい。\nありがとうございます……。", "zh": "是、是的。\n谢谢您……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1050_p", "source_sha256": "0b6b8c594d47d6181cc557e21cc72e776a93a0750665804ddf76d2384948d78e", "ja": "エミリー、今のシーンについては後で相談しよう。\n今日のところは、これで撤収だ。", "zh": "艾米莉，关于刚才那个场景，之后再商量吧。\n今天就先到这里，收工。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1051_032emi", "source_sha256": "3aa43cec538bcbf917093b47a05b03894a4dacfdb016974680da60ff538e5494", "ja": "はい、仕掛け人さま。\n……。", "zh": "好的，制作人大人。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1053_006mak", "source_sha256": "8124d084ecc901cbaef5d06e8f1404a249c955ec710f3b7c6f77afae204c1008", "ja": "エミリー、今日はお疲れさま。\n本番の撮影も、がんばろうね！", "zh": "艾米莉，今天辛苦了。\n正式拍摄也一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1054_032emi", "source_sha256": "977e1bee63c8313fbb3e461a02fe0f819be623cac646a237046c59146e838f6f", "ja": "真さま、春香さん……。あの……私……。", "zh": "真大人、春香姐姐……那个……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1055_032emi", "source_sha256": "256084292ff787c862069d33e9e39262c25e67bd42c2d0fd2f3ca95b58d544c7", "ja": "私が、みなさんと肩を並べるなんて……\nやはり、おこがましかったでしょうか……。", "zh": "我……能和大家并肩站在一起……\n果然，是太不自量力了吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1056_001har", "source_sha256": "ca2cbc4fcfe782461ee75405e2d8f06df0a02593e0bd3dedf1cd0e3aebf4212d", "ja": "ええっ！？　そんなこと、絶対ないよ！\nエミリーちゃんのお芝居、上手だったもん。", "zh": "诶！？绝对不是那样的！\n艾米莉的演技明明很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1057_006mak", "source_sha256": "e3aec06fbd2944650440a6dd2a0748cfc6e465b633e43cffd20127e252bf070d", "ja": "そうだよエミリー！　アマリリスは、\nエミリーしかいないと思う！　元気出して！", "zh": "没错，艾米莉！我觉得演阿玛莉莉丝的，非你莫属！打起精神来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1058_032emi", "source_sha256": "b2e58464abc9037fbd5e7c9af5bda822a355b19655d7776e21f52e4a18037d81", "ja": "は、はい……。\nありがとうございます……。", "zh": "是、是的……  \n谢谢您……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1059_p", "source_sha256": "9d97797b3b67fbf8cb01615d5c8b920f8dffdb4352e2539d91431758ccae9526", "ja": "（春香と真は、困った表情で顔を見合わせている……\nけど、無理もないか）", "zh": "（春香和真面面相觑，脸上露出为难的表情……\n不过，这也难怪）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1060_p", "source_sha256": "c212968f1ddcbfba0aa266cd82539da9e5a5940f7ae4f0f50aba50fa68596381", "ja": "（さっき美希と千早がしたアドバイスは、\n仲間だからこその、遠慮のないものだった）", "zh": "（刚才美希和千早给出的建议，正是因为她们是伙伴，才会如此毫不客气。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_04_1061_p", "source_sha256": "d8785db901e93d088888e041a376dd36f728075c23767bd130670eee77bca575", "ja": "（その事を理解しないと、エミリーは\n前に進めないかもしれないな……）", "zh": "（要是不理解这一点，艾米莉或许就无法继续前进了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
